# ── gstack ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# gstack is installed separately (README step 3) into this dir; its skills
# sync into the top-level folders below. None of it belongs in this repo.
# If gstack adds new skills, append them here (or regenerate this block).
#
# This block shrinks as we take skills over — see docs/degstack.md. A skill
# removed from here is ours now, tracked, and gstack's copy of it is dead.
# `review/` was the first to go.
gstack/
_gstack-command/
