# ── build output of the vendored TS skills ──────────────────────────────
# browse/ and make-pdf/ ship compiled binaries. The binaries are kept on disk
# so the skills keep working, but they are build output and 275M of it, so
# they stay untracked. Their build tooling lived in gstack; see the note in
# browse/SKILL.md before changing their source.
make-pdf/dist/
*/node_modules/
# browse/ and make-pdf/ are compiled tools: the skills invoke only dist/, and
# their build tooling lived in gstack, so tracking source we cannot compile buys
# nothing. Source stays on disk and is recoverable from github.com/garrytan/gstack
# if we ever port the build and take real ownership.
make-pdf/src/
make-pdf/test/
# ship/sections/*.md is generated from these upstream templates; we keep the
# output, not gstack's generator.

# Skills we evaluated and chose not to own (see PR #46). gstack's copies may
# still sit here on disk; they are not ours and are not tracked.
browse/
codex/
context-restore/
context-save/
diagram/
investigate/
learn/
scrape/
ship/
spec/
